[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2775200742","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/104960#issuecomment-2775200742","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/104960","id":2775200742,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6lajPm","user":{"login":"lawnjelly","id":21999379,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIxOTk5Mzc5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/21999379?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly","html_url":"https://github.com/lawnjelly","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-04-03T10:14:36Z","updated_at":"2025-04-03T10:16:53Z","body":"I don't know whether Godot 4 is compiled under 32 bit, but there `size_t` could be 32 bit.\r\n\r\nMaybe this is a limitation of mbedtls (if it takes `size_t`).\r\n\r\nWe could also consider having the Godot functions take a `uint64_t`, then `ERR_FAIL` if the size is above `size_t` range (`SIZE_MAX`) before calling mbedtls, rather than crash.\r\n\r\nThat's if there are any 32 bit builds planned.\r\n\r\nAnd there's the question of whether the calling code can cope with a failure gracefully...\r\n\r\nOn the other hand this does fix the common case of the bug as is and is an improvement on the current. ","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2775200742/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2775272416","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/104960#issuecomment-2775272416","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/104960","id":2775272416,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6la0vg","user":{"login":"akien-mga","id":4701338,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3MDEzMzg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4701338?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga","html_url":"https://github.com/akien-mga","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-04-03T10:30:35Z","updated_at":"2025-04-03T10:30:35Z","body":"We still build Godot for x86_32 on Windows, Linux and Android.\r\n\r\nAnd indeed I confirmed that with a x86_32 Windows build (compiled with MinGW and running through Wine) `size_t` is 4 bytes.","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2775272416/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2775272447","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/104960#issuecomment-2775272447","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/104960","id":2775272447,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6la0v_","user":{"login":"bruvzg","id":7645683,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc2NDU2ODM=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7645683?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg","html_url":"https://github.com/bruvzg","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-04-03T10:30:35Z","updated_at":"2025-04-03T10:30:35Z","body":"> I don't know whether Godot 4 is compiled under 32 bit, but there size_t could be 32 bit.\r\n\r\nIt's used for memory buffers, so `size_t` is a natural limit. For files there are equivalent functions in the `FileAccess`, which read file in 32K chunks.","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2775272447/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":2,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2775347150","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/104960#issuecomment-2775347150","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/104960","id":2775347150,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6lbG_O","user":{"login":"akien-mga","id":4701338,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3MDEzMzg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4701338?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga","html_url":"https://github.com/akien-mga","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-04-03T10:52:37Z","updated_at":"2025-04-03T11:19:31Z","body":"So I tested this PR on Linux x86_32 and interestingly it doesn't crash, as it seems to fail before computing the md5sum:\r\n```\r\nsavepack: begin: Packing steps: 102\r\n        savepack: step 2: Storing File: res://.godot/imported/icon.webp-e94f9a68b0f625a567a797079e4d325f.ctex\r\n        savepack: step 2: Storing File: res://icon.webp.import\r\n        savepack: step 35: Storing File: res://.godot/exported/133200997/export-3070c538c03ee49b7677ff960a3f5195-main.scn\r\nERROR: Parameter \"mem\" is null.\r\n   at: alloc_static (./core/os/memory.cpp:108)\r\nERROR: Parameter \"mem_new\" is null.\r\n   at: resize (./core/templates/cowdata.h:367)\r\n        savepack: step 68: Storing File: res://generated\r\n        savepack: step 68: Storing File: res://main.tscn.remap\r\n        savepack: step 68: Storing File: res://.godot/global_script_class_cache.cfg\r\n        savepack: step 68: Storing File: res://icon.webp\r\n        savepack: step 68: Storing File: res://.godot/uid_cache.bin\r\n        savepack: step 68: Storing File: res://project.binary\r\nsavepack: end\r\n```\r\n\r\nThe PCK is written but it's just 2896 bytes, I guess the `generated` file is included with size 0.\r\n\r\nIn general, we should probably forbid using 2.0+ GiB files with a 32-bit version of Godot, but I'm not sure how easy it would be to do this editor side.\r\n\r\nEventually we could also consider dropping 32-bit support for the editor, and keeping only export templates for people who want to target low-end hardware.","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2775347150/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":2,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2775376290","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/104960#issuecomment-2775376290","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/104960","id":2775376290,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6lbOGi","user":{"login":"bruvzg","id":7645683,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc2NDU2ODM=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7645683?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg","html_url":"https://github.com/bruvzg","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-04-03T10:57:51Z","updated_at":"2025-04-03T10:57:51Z","body":"> So I tested this PR on Linux x86_32 and interestingly it doesn't crash, as it seems to fail before computing the md5sum\r\n\r\nPCK exporter read each file to the memory as a single `PackedByteArray`, so I guess it's expected to fail before it get to the hash checks. But it's not the case for reading PCK, so exported 32-bit project should be able to access it.","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2775376290/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2775430909","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/104960#issuecomment-2775430909","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/104960","id":2775430909,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6lbbb9","user":{"login":"akien-mga","id":4701338,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3MDEzMzg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4701338?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga","html_url":"https://github.com/akien-mga","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-04-03T11:19:03Z","updated_at":"2025-04-03T11:21:26Z","body":"I tested some more with this script, and I'm surprised that `FileAccess.get_md5` actually works for that file on x86_32:\r\n```gdscript\r\nfunc _ready():\r\n\tvar size = FileAccess.get_size(\"generated\")\r\n\tprint(size)\r\n\tvar file = FileAccess.open(\"generated\", FileAccess.READ)\r\n\tprint(file.is_open())\r\n\tvar buf = file.get_buffer(size)\r\n\tprint(buf.size())\r\n\tvar md5 = FileAccess.get_md5(\"generated\")\r\n\tprint(md5)\r\n```\r\n\r\nOn x86_32 Linux:\r\n```\r\n2147483648\r\ntrue\r\nERROR: Parameter \"mem\" is null.\r\n   at: alloc_static (./core/os/memory.cpp:108)\r\nERROR: Parameter \"mem_new\" is null.\r\n   at: resize (./core/templates/cowdata.h:367)\r\nERROR: Can't resize data to 2147483648 elements.\r\n   at: get_buffer (./core/io/file_access.cpp:545)\r\n0\r\na981130cf2b7e09f4686dc273cf7187e\r\n```\r\n\r\nOn x86_64 Linux:\r\n```\r\n2147483648\r\ntrue\r\n2147483648\r\na981130cf2b7e09f4686dc273cf7187e\r\n```\r\n\r\nIt seems like `FileAccess::get_md5` uses a different approach with a MD5Context and doesn't call `mbedtls_md5_ret` directly.","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2775430909/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2775440586","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/104960#issuecomment-2775440586","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/104960","id":2775440586,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6lbdzK","user":{"login":"bruvzg","id":7645683,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc2NDU2ODM=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7645683?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg","html_url":"https://github.com/bruvzg","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-04-03T11:22:12Z","updated_at":"2025-04-03T11:22:12Z","body":"> and I'm surprised that FileAccess.get_md5 actually works for that file on x86_32\r\n\r\nWhy wouldn't it, it's reading 32 KiB at a time and file offset is always 64-bit.","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2775440586/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2776004232","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/104960#issuecomment-2776004232","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/104960","id":2776004232,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6ldnaI","user":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-04-03T14:35:09Z","updated_at":"2025-04-03T14:35:09Z","body":"Thanks!","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2776004232/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]